<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal &amp; Compliance Framework for LLP Partner Change</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Section 22:</strong> Admission of partners &ndash; per LLP Agreement or consent of all</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 24:</strong> Cessation &ndash; retirement/resignation, 30-day notice if silent</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 24(5):</strong> Retiring partner &ndash; original contribution + accumulated profit share</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 25:</strong> Filing notice of change with Registrar &ndash; Form 4 within 30 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 7/8:</strong> Designated partners &ndash; minimum 2, at least 1 Indian resident</li>
                    <li><strong>Schedule I:</strong> Default rules when agreement silent &ndash; consent of all for admission</li>
                    <li><strong>Form 4:</strong> Partner/DP change notice &ndash; within 30 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Form 3:</strong> Supplementary agreement &ndash; linked form within 30 days</li>
                    <li><strong>DIR-3:</strong> DPIN application for new designated partners</li>
                    <li><strong>FEMA:</strong> LLP-I (admission) and LLP-II (exit) on FIRMS portal</li>
                    <li><strong>Minimum Partners:</strong> 2 at all times; sole partner personally liable after 6 months</li>
                    <li><strong>Penalty:</strong> Rs 100/day per form &ndash; no cap</li>
                    <li><strong>ROC Mumbai:</strong> Everest House, 100 Marine Lines, Mumbai 400020</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Filing Portals:</strong> <a href="https://www.mca.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mca.gov.in</a> (MCA V3) | <a href="https://firms.rbi.org.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">firms.rbi.org.in</a> (FIRMS)</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

